{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin_chief","model_identifier":"goblin_chief","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin_chief\n\nGoblin chief (C4, night raids), 1.2 m = 43 u (46 u to the helmet horn; hunched ~43 u).\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. The chief is broader and darker-skinned: a fur hide mantle, iron pauldrons, a studded leather chest piece, a dented iron helmet with a nose guard and one snapped horn, and a big chipped cleaver. Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades).\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..48.0, z -7.5..6.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 20 x 44 x 13 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `attack_cleave` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: diagonal overhead chop (reach ~22 u); wind-up 0.3 |\n| `shout` | 1.6 | once | rallying bellow, cleaver overhead, fist pumping 0.3-1.25 s (key 0.5: buff nearby goblins) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 42.7 u/s (1.20 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 29.9 u per cycle\n- `run`: 138.7 u/s (3.90 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 58.2 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 152.5 u/s (4.29 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 58.0 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_cleave`: key 0.45 s: diagonal overhead chop (reach ~22 u); wind-up 0.3\n- `shout`: rallying bellow, cleaver overhead, fist pumping 0.3-1.25 s (key 0.5: buff nearby goblins)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `cleaver` (visible, under slot_hand_r): blade 16 u along -Z, edge along -Y, grip at the origin\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- The helmet is modelled on the head bone (slot_head sits on its crown).\n- Variant texture: goblin_chief_scarred.png (grey fur, red-brown leather).\n"},"description":"# goblin_chief\n\nGoblin chief (C4, night raids), 1.2 m = 43 u (46 u to the helmet horn; hunched ~43 u).\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. The chief is broader and darker-skinned: a fur hide mantle, iron pauldrons, a studded leather chest piece, a dented iron helmet with a nose guard and one snapped horn, and a big chipped cleaver. Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades).\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..48.0, z -7.5..6.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 20 x 44 x 13 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `attack_cleave` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: diagonal overhead chop (reach ~22 u); wind-up 0.3 |\n| `shout` | 1.6 | once | rallying bellow, cleaver overhead, fist pumping 0.3-1.25 s (key 0.5: buff nearby goblins) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 42.7 u/s (1.20 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 29.9 u per cycle\n- `run`: 138.7 u/s (3.90 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 58.2 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 152.5 u/s (4.29 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 58.0 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_cleave`: key 0.45 s: diagonal overhead chop (reach ~22 u); wind-up 0.3\n- `shout`: rallying bellow, cleaver overhead, fist pumping 0.3-1.25 s (key 0.5: buff nearby goblins)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `cleaver` (visible, under slot_hand_r): blade 16 u along -Z, edge along -Y, grip at the origin\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- The helmet is modelled on the head bone (slot_head sits on its crown).\n- Variant texture: goblin_chief_scarred.png (grey fur, red-brown leather).\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,18.0,-3.0],"to":[4.5,22.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,18.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[118,43,127.0,47.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[27,49,33.0,53.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,49,9.0,53.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[33,49,39.0,53.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[104,36,113.0,42.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[113,36,122.0,42.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"27f83674-c564-587a-bcc4-8af0ff546b3d"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,22.0,-3.5],"to":[5.5,34.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,22.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[26,0,37.0,12.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[48,0,55.0,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[37,0,48.0,12.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[55,0,62.0,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[64,27,75.0,34.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[75,27,86.0,34.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d56f2bfa-c3aa-526f-90b7-96628ea9050e"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,34.0,-1.5],"to":[1.5,35.0,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[84,58,87.0,59.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[87,58,90.0,59.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[90,58,93.0,59.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[93,58,96.0,59.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12,53,15.0,56.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[15,53,18.0,56.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c231fd1a-419e-596e-bb08-6a50130754d2"},{"name":"head","box_